<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="HAG" style="id">Haggai</book>
  <para style="h">Haggai</para>
  <para style="toc1">Haggai</para>
  <para style="toc2">Haggai</para>
  <para style="mt">Haggai</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kumpipa Darias vaihawm kum nihna, kha gukna, a kha a ni khat ni’n, Judah ukpipa Sialtiel tapa Zerubbabel kiang leh, siampu lian, Jehozadak tapa Joshua kiang ah zawlnei Haggai a kipan Toupa thu a hongtung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hichibang in sepaihte Toupa’n thu a gen: hiai mite’n, eite i kisak a Toupa inn lam hun ahi kei a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchi in zawlnei Haggai a kipan in Toupa thu a hongtung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hiai inn kigawpsa a om a, nou adia na intung dalneite ua na ten hun uh ahi maw? chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huaiziak in tuin sepaihte Toupa’n : Na lampite uh ngaihtuah un, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tampi na tuh ua, tawmchik na la uh; na ne ua, himahleh na vahkei uh; na dawn ua, himahleh na dawnkham zoukei uh; na kisilh ua, himahleh kuamah na lum kei uh; loh mu in iptaw vangsa a koih ding in loh a mu hi, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sepaihte Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Na lampite uh ngaihtuah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tang ah hohtou unla, sing vala unla, inn lam un; huai ah ka kipak ding a, hihthupi in ka om ding, Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tampi na lamen ua, ngai un, tawmchik a honghi hi; inn na hontut chiang un, ka na mutmang hi. Bangding in? Sepaihte Toupa’n a chi. Michih noumau inn tuam ah na tai chiat ua, kei inn pen kigawp a a om ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huaiziak in noute ziak in van in a daitui a khou a, lei in a gah a khou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi in, gam, tang, buh leh uain, sathau ah lei in a hon suahkhiak leh, mi leh ganhon leh, khut nasep tengteng tung ah keuna ka samta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi in Sialtiel tapa Zerubbabel leh siampu lian Jehozadak tapa Joshua in mi omsunte tengteng toh Toupa a Pathian uh aw leh Toupa a Pathian un a sawl, zawlnei Haggai thute a mang ua; huan mite’n Toupa a lau taktak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Toupa thukhah in Toupa sawltak Haggai in mite kiang ah thu a gen a, Toupa’n , Na kiang uah ka om, a chi, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Judah ukpipa Sialtiel tapa Zerubbabel kha leh, siampu lian, Jehozadak tapa Joshua kha leh, mi omsunte tengteng kha Toupa’n a tokthou a; a kuan ua sepaihte Toupa , a Pathian uh inn ah na a semta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A kha a ni sawmnih leh li ni, a kha gukna, kumpipa Darias vaihawm kum nihna in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kha sagihna, kha a a ni sawmnih leh khatna in, zawlnei Haggai a kipan Toupa thu a hongtung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Judah ukpipa Sialtiel tapa Zerubbabel kiang ah, leh siampu lian, Jehozadak tapa Joshua kiang leh, mi omsunte kiang ah tu’n thu gen in, chi in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuma a a thupina a hiai inn mu na lak uah kua na omlai ua? Huan tuin bangchibang in na mu ua? Na mitmuh un bangmahlou bang ahi maw? chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Himahleh, Zerubbabel aw, hattak in om in, Toupa’n a chi; Joshua, siampu lian, Jehozadak tapa aw, hattak in om in; nou gam a mite tengteng aw, hattak in om unla, nasem un, Toupa’n a chi; na kiang ua ka om ziak in, sepaihte Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aigupta gam a kipan na hong paikhiaklai ua na kiang ua thu ka khun a, na lak ua ka kha a om gige dan theigige un; lau kei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi ngal a; Khatvei lai, sawtloukal in, vante, lei leh tuipi, gamhulte tan in ka sing ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nam tengteng ka sing ding a, huchi in nam tengteng thildeihte a hongtung ding, huchi in hiai inn thupina in ka dimsak ding, sepaihte Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Dangka kei a ahi, dangkaeng kei a ahi, sepaihte Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hiai inn thupina nanung amasa sang in, a thupizaw ding, sepaihte Toupa’n a chi; hiailai mun ah muanna ka pe ding, sepaihte Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Darias kum nihna, a kha kua a ni sawmnih leh lina in, zawlnei Haggai a kipan in Toupa thu a hongtung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sepaihte Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Tuin danlam thu a siampute dong un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Min a puansilh puanten ah sa siangthou lou leh a puanten in tanghou hiam, meh hiam, uain hiam, sa hiam sukha leh a hong siangthou diam? chi in. siampute’n, ‘Ii’ chi in a dawng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Haggai in, “Misi luang ziak a mi nin in hiaite a bangpeuh khoih leh siang in a om diam?” a chi hi. siampute’n a dawng ua, “Sianglou in a om ding” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Haggai in a dawng a, Toupa’n , huchibang in hiai mite, leh huchibang in hiai nam ka ma ah ahi uh; huchibang in a khutte uh nasep chiteng; leh huailai a a thillat uh a siangkei, a chi, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi in tuin, k’on ngen ahi, tuni a kipan leh a banban in, Toupa biakin a suang a kichian ma in ngaihtuah un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tehna sawmnih kivum min a hong muhlai, huai nite a om nung siah, sawmkhat kia a om hi; bawm sawmnga a dim khe ding a min uain thau a hon muhlai in, sawmnih kia a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na khut nasepte tengteng uah keuna leh kawtluatna leh gial in k’on gawt a; huchipi in leng kei lam na hong ngakei uh, Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />K’on ngen ahi, tuni a kipan leh a banban in, Toupa biakin suangphum a kiphum ni a kipan, a kha kua na a ni sawmnih leh li ni a kipan, ngaihtuah un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Buhpang ah haichi a omlai hia? Ahi, grepgui, theipi kung, theibuhfai, olive sing a hongsuak kei lai a; tuni a kipan in k’on vualzawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huai kha a ni sawmnih leh li ni’n Haggai kiang ah a nihveina in Toupa thu a hongtung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Judah ukpipa Zerubbabel kiang ah, Van leh lei ka sing ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lalgam leh laltutphahte ka lumlet ding a, namte, lalgamte hatna ka suse ding a, kangtalaite leh huai a tuangte ka pai ding; huchi in sakolte leh a tung ua tuangmite a hongkum ding uh, michih a unau namsau in satlum ding a chi, chi in thugen in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huai ni chiang in Aw Zerubbabel, ka sikha, Sialtiel tapa, ka honla ding, sepaihte Toupa’n a chi, suai namna in k’on bawl ding, Toupa’n , a chi; nang ka hontelta ngal a, sepaihte Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
</usx>
